<span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=220 valign=top style='width:164.8pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Reference\r\nRange:-<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Female<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;text-autospace:none'><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;text-autospace:none'><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>14<sup>th<\/sup> weeks\r\n\u2013 0.14 \u2013 0.61 ng\/ml\u00a0 | 15<sup>th<\/sup> weeks \u2013 0.26 \u2013 0.86 ng\/ml\u00a0 <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;text-autospace:none'><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>16<sup>th<\/sup> weeks\r\n\u2013 0.38 \u2013 1.16 ng\/ml\u00a0 | 17<sup>th<\/sup> weeks \u2013 0.52 \u2013 1.55 ng\/ml\u00a0 <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;text-autospace:none'><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>18<sup>th<\/sup> weeks\r\n\u2013 0.77 \u2013 2.15 ng\/ml\u00a0 | 19<sup>th<\/sup> weeks \u2013 1.00 \u2013 3.02 ng\/ml\u00a0 <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;text-autospace:none'><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>20<sup>th<\/sup> weeks\r\n\u2013 0.89 \u2013 4.49 ng\/ml\u00a0 | 20<sup>th<\/sup> weeks \u2013 1.13 \u2013 6.47 ng\/ml\u00a0 <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;text-autospace:none'><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>21<sup>th<\/sup> weeks\r\n\u2013 1.80 \u2013 9.10 ng\/ml<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;text-autospace:none'><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;text-autospace:none'><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;text-autospace:none'><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Clinical Significance:<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>There is a considerable patient\r\nto patient variability: The reference range for a given gestational age may\r\nencompass Estriol levels from 50 to 200 percent of the median for that age.\r\nHence the pattern generated by serial determination is of greater significance\r\nthan the results of isolated measurements. Persistently low or rapidly falling\r\nEstroil levels suggest fetal distress. Estriol concentration are subject to\r\ndiurnal and episodic variation; Please refer serum levels to a baseline Defined\r\nfor the patient as either the average or the highest of her three most recent\r\nEstriol results.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Please correlate\r\nwith clinical conditions.<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><